        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Choosing between an SGLT2 inhibitor and a GLP-1 receptor agonist as a first-line or early-line therapy for type 2 diabetes depends on a patient's specific health profile, primary risk factors, and treatment goals, according to guidelines from the American Diabetes Association .",
